          "end": 11.97,
          "en": "when it comes to handling forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.97,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "It offers the template-driven approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "which is called like this because there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "you simply set up your form in the template, in HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 23.97,
          "en": "and Angular will automatically infer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
