          "en": "the structure of your form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.68,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "will infer it which controls your forms, has which inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 33.27,
          "en": "and makes it easy for you to get started quickly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.27,
          "end": 37.44,
          "en": "It also has a more complex approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
